                                <L-2 L="EN">This represents the configuration of whether an AUTOSAR Follow_Up ICV Sub-TLV is used or not.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">- true: This represents a configuration where an AUTOSAR Follow_Up ICV Sub-TLV is used. - false: This represents a configuration where an AUTOSAR Follow_Up ICV Sub-TLV is not used.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthTSyn_00095</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
